              "en": "Research question in the same fictional archive: “Which chemical and technical data matter for reducing fresh solvent in the model process?” Analogue/digital catalogue as above. Dossier D explains material balance, dossier E contains complex operating data on reuse, rejects and energy; dossier F states a policy aim. No real factory data."
