              "en": "Actually choose and use suitable analogue/digital models: compare atomic models with data, compute Q and test x=0/0.10/0.20 in a table to the equilibrium solution. Justify statements, limits and possible development at both stations. This case alone does not complete the second case’s complex-molecule contexts."
