              "en": "Shell model organises outer/core relations and qualitative periodicity better than balls but does not exactly calculate 496/738; higher nuclear charge with similar main shell supports stronger binding in Mg. Q immediately after addition = 0.5<K; x=0.10 gives Q=1.21/1.71≈0.7076; x=0.20 gives 1.44/1.44=1, so new equilibrium A1.8/B0.8/C1.2/D1.2. The table is actually created, not merely read. Ideal concentration rule neglects activities and kinetics; development needs suitable activity/energy data."
